        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_broad_bean_field_growing",
        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungibroadbeanfieldgrowing_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Rows of grey-green bean plants with black-and-white flowers. The beans will be ready when the pods swell."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_broad_bean_field_growing",
        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungibroadbeanfieldgrowing_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Growth:</b> Takes 30 days to mature.\n\n<b>Harvest:</b> Once mature, harvest for 6 to 9 Broad Beans.\n\n<b>Care:</b> Tend it once a day. Left untended it weakens and dies in about ten days. In winter it stops growing and dies in about two days, so harvest before the frost."
    },
